1
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:05,600
NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED DURING
THE FILMING OF THIS PRODUCTION

2
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:11,400
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

3
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:17,960
Open up! Trusting a Turk?
A woman! Trusting a Cuman woman!

4
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:25,280
Faltyos was right. My dear friend!
They imprisoned you!

5
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:32,440
I need more soldiers.
I need more weapons!

6
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:37,400
I need to push Osman and
his Alps into an open field.

7
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:40,320
Then in one move…

8
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:45,040
… in one move, I’ll
take all of them down.

9
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:49,480
No tricks. No games.
No mysteries!

10
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:58,000
Rome against Turks. Osman
against Nikola! That’s how it will happen.

11
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,640
Yes. Exactly like this!

12
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:06,680
I’ll crush them down
with a well-armed army, but!

13
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:12,280
But! There are no
soldiers Rome can give me!

14
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,560
Is that it?

15
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,400
Unfortunately.

16
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:24,360
Okay. How will I beat
that shepherd then? How?

17
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:35,120
The Holy Emperor thought
you knew the answer to that.

18
00:03:55,760 --> 00:04:00,720
Did this guy just criticise me?

19
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,960
The Emperor…

20
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:19,079
Either he’ll find soldiers for me,
or I’ll get them from Geyhatu!

21
00:04:19,079 --> 00:04:21,519
But I will find them!

22
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,840
Selamun Aleykum [Peace be with you]

23
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,800
Father!

24
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:10,200
I’ll make these lands you’ve conquered…

25
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:15,320
… the lands of the Turks!

26
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:17,840
In the eyes of the oppressed…

27
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:22,480
I’ll be hope, not tears.

28
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:26,720
I’ll be the nightmare of the cruel!

29
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:29,440
Now…

30
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:36,040
With the prayers of
the oppressed from all religions…

31
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:42,120
… all over these lands…

32
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:45,400
… I’ll expand my borders.

33
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,920
My ancestor Oghuz Khan…

34
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:57,920
My grandfather Suleiman Shah…

35
00:06:57,920 --> 00:07:01,240
… and you…

36
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:05,640
I’ll be worthy of your bloodline, and
your traditions.

37
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:13,600
Today is the day of
the Bey council, father.

38
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:20,120
May Allah, not let us down.

39
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,760
Let’s hope for the best.

40
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:05,480
Selamun Aleykum. [Peace be with you]

41
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:07,720
Aleykum Selam. [Peave be with you too]

42
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:40,440
Where do you come from,
where do you go to?

43
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:43,440
We came from Aleppo
to Söğut to trade, my Bey.

44
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,520
Merchant Abdullah Bin Malik.

45
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:49,640
I used to be his slave.
Now I’m his son.

46
00:08:51,360 --> 00:09:00,080
I’ve heard that our mighty Ertuğrul
Bey who saved my life has passed away.

47
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:13,280
In fact, the reason I came here
was to ask for his blessings.

48
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:17,960
My father had told me.

49
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:21,880
Your caravan got attacked
by the Mongols while you were here.

50
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:28,720
My father protected your
lives and your goods. Is that correct?

51
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,560
Your father?

52
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:43,080
Are you Osman Bey,
the son of Ertuğrul Bey?

53
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:46,880
Osman Bey!

54
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:55,520
If you allow me, my valiant,
I’d like to give you a hug!

55
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,480
Sorry for your loss.

56
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:12,160
May our Ertuğrul Bey rest in peace.

57
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:15,760
Thank you.

58
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:22,840
I see the light of your
father in your eyes, son.

59
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,680
But…

60
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:32,640
Those who attacked
my caravan weren’t Mongols.

61
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:36,480
They were the soldiers
of Lord Vasilius.

62
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:48,240
Then, welcome to Söğüt,
Melik Bin Abdullah.

63
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:50,240
Thank you.

64
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:54,520
What about you?

65
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:59,320
I was freed from the oppression
of the cruel, thanks to Ertuğrul Bey.

66
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:06,040
After seeing that I had no one,
your father gave me a name.

67
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:08,320
May he rest in peace.

68
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:14,240
He granted me his father's name.

69
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:18,400
Süleiman.

70
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:24,520
Not just a name,
he gave me a father...

71
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:28,760
... and three valiant brothers,
far from home.

72
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:37,600
Thanks to my Allah that
I'm before Osman Bey, my brother.

73
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:46,440
Welcome, brother!

74
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,440
Thank you.

75
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:54,560
Be my guest at the inn.

76
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:59,960
Now, your lives and
goods are safe with Kayı.

77
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:04,040
And Kayı Tent is now your homes.

78
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:07,120
May Allah bless you, Osman Bey.

79
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:17,000
If you become the Bey...

80
00:12:18,240 --> 00:12:24,720
... may you be
the hope of the world of Islam...

81
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:27,480
... with many conquest
in your father's path.

82
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:54,080
It's time, my Savcı.

83
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:57,680
It's time you keep
your promise to me and Kayı.

84
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:05,800
Now go and show
those Beys what a Kayı Bey is.

85
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:09,680
I'll be waiting for good news from you.

86
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:16,080
Don't worry, Hatun.
There is no other possibility.

87
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:20,440
I'll be chosen the Bey
and everyone will have to accept it.

88
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:24,400
This took too long
and I'm out of patience.

89
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:31,680
After you're the Kayı's Bey,
I'll be their Hatun.

90
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:38,280
While you're putting
the Beys in their places...

91
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:40,960
... I'll put Selcan and Bala to theirs.

92
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:49,440
And of course, get my revenge
from Aygül who drew her sword to me.

93
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:56,480
Everthing will be accounted for.
One by one.

94
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:22,000
Boran Alp! Time of the meeting is close.

95
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,800
Say what you have to say.

96
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:26,920
I want to talk about this meeting.

97
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:30,480
My brother Göktuğ
and I are competent in battle.

98
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:33,440
We fight by our Osman Bey's side.

99
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:38,720
You also know that we were
victorious with Osman Bey many times.

100
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:43,520
We saw enemy's armies
scatter, their castles fall.

101
00:14:43,520 --> 00:14:49,800
We know that if Osman Bey wasn't here,
we would have gotten those victories.

102
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:58,160
Now, Kayı will be victorious many
times only if Osman Bey becomes the Bey.

103
00:14:58,160 --> 00:15:03,920
We want you to think
about this during the council.

104
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:13,640
You did everything that suited you.

105
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:17,960
And we'll do everything that suits us.

106
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:22,840
What is it that suits you?

107
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:25,320
This isn't right, Boran Alp.

108
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:28,760
This isn't the place where
we announce our Bey.

109
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:34,680
Excuse us.
Take care of yourselves.

110
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:44,520
They didn't say anything.

111
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:49,400
- I hope they got the message.
- Inshallah.

112
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:52,040
Let's go.

113
00:16:11,800 --> 00:16:15,760
It is time we become a state!

114
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:27,080
I'll show you how one
becomes a state, Osman Bey.

115
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:37,360
Tell me how you will show him
so that I can also be happy, Dündar Bey.

116
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:47,120
Today, I'll become the Bey.

117
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:53,400
How?

118
00:16:56,160 --> 00:16:58,520
What are you saying, Dündar Bey?

119
00:17:00,040 --> 00:17:02,840
How will that happen?

120
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:05,839
What did you do?

121
00:17:05,839 --> 00:17:08,359
May I enter, my Bey?

122
00:17:08,359 --> 00:17:10,319
Come in, Saltuk.

123
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:18,040
My Bey, I've completed your order.

124
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:23,839
Tell us what you did so
that Hazal Hatun knows them.

125
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:27,040
Come on.

126
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:33,680
As you ordered, I've handed
out the gold to the Beys.

127
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:37,320
They promised to vote for you today.

128
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:43,680
You may leave, Saltuk.

129
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:54,520
My Bey!

130
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:58,320
What have you done?

131
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:06,400
This isn't a job for Savcı, Hatun.

132
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:11,280
I saw that he can't take care of Osman.
I won't wait for them to fight each other.

133
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:16,520
I'll be the Bey right away.

134
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:33,480
My lion! My man!
Head of my Tent!

135
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:44,360
May you be an honored Bey.

136
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:48,960
I'll wait for the news.

137
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:53,880
I'll wait to take our revenge.

138
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:59,760
I'll wait, to celebrate
all day and all night.

139
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:17,720
My mighty creator...

140
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,960
... show me that moment.

141
00:19:28,360 --> 00:19:31,600
Oh, Dündar Bey!

142
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:44,040
Alps. Is everything ready?
Did you complete your duties?

143
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:46,640
We have, my Bey.

144
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:52,720
But there's something new.
Dündar Bey bribed three voters, my Bey.

145
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:59,720
With gold, my Bey.
He asked them to support him.

146
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:07,320
Uncle...

147
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:10,880
So, he also deceived
my brother Savcı.

148
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:15,280
How did you find this out?

149
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:18,520
Saltuk. Don't be
shy brother, tell us.

150
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:23,040
Dündar Bey...

151
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:28,520
I'm thankful of Dündar
Bey for lots of things. He trusted me.

152
00:20:28,520 --> 00:20:34,120
But he gave up acting like a Kayı Bey.

153
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:39,840
Saltuk. Tell us brother.
What did Dündar Bey do?

154
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:46,560
He wanted me
to hand gold out to Beys.

155
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:51,360
They'll vote Dündar Bey.

156
00:20:51,360 --> 00:20:55,560
He bribed all
the Beys except for the Blacksmith.

157
00:20:55,560 --> 00:21:00,120
Look at that Dündar Bey!

158
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:05,480
Thank you, brother.
You should go.

159
00:21:05,480 --> 00:21:10,560
Don't mention this to anyone else.
We'll tell Osman Bey about this.

160
00:21:11,760 --> 00:21:18,960
That what he said, huh? I'd love
to strangle my uncle and expose this.

161
00:21:18,960 --> 00:21:24,640
But then, they will
know that Saltuk spoke.

162
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:30,600
We shall wait.

163
00:21:30,600 --> 00:21:36,080
If that's the case, my Bey, we
should crush the Beys who took bribes!

164
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:41,800
Slow down, Gence Bey. Don't rush it.

165
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:47,760
We'll get through this
with our minds, not anger.

166
00:21:51,520 --> 00:21:54,880
May I enter, my Bey?

167
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:57,320
Come in, Dumrul.

168
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,400
Selamun Aleykum.
[Peave be with you]

169
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:01,360
Aleykum Selam.
[Peace be with you too]

170
00:22:01,800 --> 00:22:05,280
My Bey, Cerkutay
wants your permisson to come here.

171
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:10,600
Let him come.

172
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:22,680
What are you doing here on
the day of council, Cerkutay?

173
00:22:22,680 --> 00:22:26,240
There will be chaos if
they don't choose you as a Bey.

174
00:22:27,280 --> 00:22:29,880
I thought you'd need manpower.

175
00:22:36,800 --> 00:22:39,800
What about they choose
me as a Bey?

176
00:22:39,800 --> 00:22:42,920
I thought then, there
would be a feast!

177
00:22:47,560 --> 00:22:52,240
Alps! Do you see this?

178
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:57,680
No one but Allah
can see who is on whose side.

179
00:23:18,600 --> 00:23:23,640
Think about a solution for this thing.

180
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:26,280
As you order, my Bey.

181
00:23:36,640 --> 00:23:39,520
Welcome, brother.

182
00:24:33,680 --> 00:24:35,240
Selamun Aleykum.

183
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:38,720
- Aleykum Selam.
- Aleykum Selam.

184
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:43,200
I've been waiting for you
for days, Melik Bin Abdullah. Welcome.

185
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:51,800
I believe you are the potter
İdris whom I'll be collaborating with.

186
00:24:51,800 --> 00:24:56,280
Correct. I've placed your men to the inn.

187
00:24:56,280 --> 00:24:59,920
They all are comfortable, thankfully.

188
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:07,360
Good. We've visited
Ertuğrul Ghazi's grave and prayed.

189
00:25:07,360 --> 00:25:09,880
May Allah accept it.

190
00:25:09,880 --> 00:25:14,560
We've also met
Osman Bey in the mean time.

191
00:25:19,120 --> 00:25:24,080
- We will be his guests.
- Good.

192
00:25:24,080 --> 00:25:29,080
The light in his eyes
reminded me of his father.

193
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:40,240
It does, it does.
Let me take you to your rooms.

194
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:20,920
The truth comes to
light after doors are closed.

195
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:31,440
Let there be light.

196
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:41,920
And God said, "Let there be light,"
and there was light.

197
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:47,280
Powerful and free.

198
00:26:47,280 --> 00:26:53,160
I bless your aweakening from
the darkness, my brother David.

199
00:26:54,600 --> 00:27:01,720
I have been reborn on the
arms of the holy Father, Master Petrus.

200
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:16,840
How did you convince Osman Bey
that you were his father's old friends?

201
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:20,440
He didn't believe us at first.

202
00:27:21,560 --> 00:27:24,280
He gave us wrong
information to trick us.

203
00:27:24,280 --> 00:27:28,800
Your caravan was attacked
by Mongols while you were in Söğüt.

204
00:27:28,800 --> 00:27:33,760
My father protected your
lives and your goods. Right?

205
00:27:33,760 --> 00:27:37,880
After Ertuğrul saved you and this gimp...

206
00:27:37,880 --> 00:27:42,880
... who attacked your caravan? Mongols?

207
00:27:42,880 --> 00:27:46,320
... Lord Vasilius and his soldiers.

208
00:27:49,520 --> 00:27:57,120
What about you, David? Could you get
the information the Father asked you to?

209
00:27:57,120 --> 00:28:03,640
I think Ertuğrul gave his
plans to a brother figure before he died.

210
00:28:03,640 --> 00:28:07,200
- He might have what you are looking for.
- Who?

211
00:28:07,240 --> 00:28:11,840
Bamsı. Bamsı Bey.

212
00:28:12,880 --> 00:28:18,280
After Ertuğrul got sick.
Bamsı was nowhere to be seen for a while.

213
00:28:18,280 --> 00:28:20,560
He appeared out of nowhere one day.

214
00:28:20,560 --> 00:28:24,240
But he kept disappearing
from the Tent secretly.

215
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:26,800
Do you know where he goes to?

216
00:28:26,800 --> 00:28:31,360
He lost me at the Mount
Abdalan's foot everytime.

217
00:28:36,520 --> 00:28:39,880
Oh, the Sultan of the Ghazis!

218
00:28:44,880 --> 00:28:50,160
Here are your relics!

219
00:28:51,920 --> 00:28:58,280
I remember the things you said while
trusting me with these like yesterday.

220
00:29:07,960 --> 00:29:11,720
"My Bamsı!", you said to me.

221
00:29:11,720 --> 00:29:16,280
"Protect these as if
they were your honour!"

222
00:29:17,800 --> 00:29:20,160
I did, my Bey.

223
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:25,520
I protected them like my honour!

224
00:29:25,520 --> 00:29:34,360
Now, it's time I deliver
these to your successor.

225
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:40,640
It is time these are in
the hands of the new Bey.

226
00:29:52,640 --> 00:29:59,240
Inshallah, the Bey elected,
will be Osman Bey.

227
00:29:59,240 --> 00:30:02,120
Allah forbid if it is someone else...

228
00:30:02,120 --> 00:30:04,640
... we're doomed.

229
00:30:05,640 --> 00:30:09,960
Today in Kayı Tent...

230
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:17,520
... both Kayı's and the world of Turks'
future will be determined.

231
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:23,920
And that is what these relics tell.

232
00:30:28,520 --> 00:30:31,320
Oh, the ancestor of all Ghazis...

233
00:30:33,520 --> 00:30:39,280
Oh, the Sultan of Ghazis.
My beautiful Bey...

234
00:30:41,520 --> 00:30:45,665
I need to be at the council of Beys
on time. I need to get going. Excuse me.

235
00:30:45,665 --> 00:30:47,365
Good.

236
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:52,400
Now go and
learn who the new Bey is.

237
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:57,480
Bamsı will take us and
the new Bey to the secret spot.

238
00:31:01,400 --> 00:31:06,880
I'll go to see Lord Nikola.
I don't want to go empty handed.

239
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:09,440
You'll send a gift to him.

240
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:12,400
As you order, Master Petrus.

241
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:17,560
You'll kidnap Flatyus
from the tent tonight.

242
00:31:44,040 --> 00:31:45,960
Is everything read, uncle?

243
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:52,720
Don't worry, nephew. I spoke to
them again. All of them will support you.

244
00:31:52,720 --> 00:31:57,400
This will end today.

245
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:05,720
I hope Osman accepts it peacefully.

246
00:32:06,960 --> 00:32:12,720
If he denies the Beys' decisions,
neither will Bamsı.

247
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:22,760
They have to accept it.
If they don't, no one will support them.

248
00:32:22,760 --> 00:32:27,600
We'll crush their words!

249
00:32:50,760 --> 00:32:53,040
Gündüz, my son.

250
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:56,920
May he rest in peace.

251
00:32:58,200 --> 00:33:03,920
You know the lion which sleeps
inside Ertuğrul Bey's heart, don't you?

252
00:33:06,240 --> 00:33:09,520
I know, Bamsı Bey.

253
00:33:24,240 --> 00:33:30,560
Then you also know who
the Kayı's future belongs to, son.

254
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:34,120
The future of Kayı.

255
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:41,120
We'll wait and see, Bamsı Bey.

256
00:33:56,160 --> 00:33:58,240
Selamın Aleykum.

257
00:33:58,240 --> 00:34:02,360
Aleykum Selam, son.
Come.

258
00:34:10,280 --> 00:34:12,840
Take it, son.

259
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:19,639
Son...

260
00:34:23,880 --> 00:34:27,080
With Allah's permission...

261
00:34:28,120 --> 00:34:33,520
You will enter this tent as my son...

262
00:34:33,560 --> 00:34:37,679
... and you'll exit as my Bey, Inshallah.

263
00:34:37,679 --> 00:34:42,520
Inshallah, Bamsı Bey.

264
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:47,199
You already know who
I'll vote for, Osman Bey.

265
00:34:47,199 --> 00:34:52,159
When it's my time to talk, I'll
speak a few extra words.

266
00:34:52,159 --> 00:34:54,400
Thank you.

267
00:34:56,719 --> 00:34:59,200
Let's go then.

268
00:35:18,960 --> 00:35:22,560
Hunter of lions, Flatyos!

269
00:35:28,040 --> 00:35:31,680
Do you go outside
without your Osman Bey?

270
00:35:34,240 --> 00:35:36,000
Have fun while you can.

271
00:35:37,120 --> 00:35:40,200
Since these are your last moments.

272
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:47,240
Do you think I fear death?

273
00:35:47,240 --> 00:35:49,800
You're scared like a dog!

274
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:54,280
Your words don't matter.
Your eyes tell the truth.

275
00:35:55,240 --> 00:36:01,200
After the council of Beys ends, we'll
make you choose your death.

276
00:36:04,800 --> 00:36:07,760
Will your Bey win the voting?

277
00:36:13,440 --> 00:36:16,360
He will.

278
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:20,520
Then we'll attack all your castles.

279
00:36:20,520 --> 00:36:24,120
First İnegöl, then Yayılhisar!

280
00:36:24,120 --> 00:36:27,320
Then İznik! And even Bursa!

281
00:36:34,240 --> 00:36:37,200
Brothers! The council is about to begin.

282
00:36:41,200 --> 00:36:43,520
Let's go, my Boran.

283
00:36:45,240 --> 00:36:46,840
Let's go.

284
00:36:56,080 --> 00:36:58,880
After I get out of here...

285
00:36:59,800 --> 00:37:03,800
I'll make all of you pay for this.

286
00:37:13,557 --> 00:37:16,687
With the name of Allah.

287
00:37:18,802 --> 00:37:22,802
With Allah's 99 name...

288
00:37:22,802 --> 00:37:26,802
...who creates everything...

289
00:37:28,612 --> 00:37:33,502
...who fills our hearts with faith.

290
00:37:43,078 --> 00:37:47,258
Al-Fatihah for the soul of...

291
00:37:47,468 --> 00:37:50,008
...the late Ertuğrul Ghazi.

292
00:38:12,589 --> 00:38:14,729
Beys of the Kayı...

293
00:38:15,029 --> 00:38:21,899
...I welcome you all,
one by one.

294
00:38:23,532 --> 00:38:25,212
Thank you.

295
00:38:27,506 --> 00:38:31,506
As the eldest bey of the Kayı...

296
00:38:32,598 --> 00:38:38,018
...I'm responsible for managing
this meeting.

297
00:38:39,538 --> 00:38:46,713
Beys, the late Ertuğrul Bey's
three sons...

298
00:38:46,713 --> 00:38:53,423
...and his one brother can claim
the position of bey...

299
00:38:53,452 --> 00:38:57,452
...according to our traditions.

300
00:38:58,722 --> 00:39:07,322
May Allah bless our decision,
and help us choose the best.

301
00:39:07,322 --> 00:39:10,028
Amin.
Amin.

302
00:39:12,065 --> 00:39:16,065
Beys of the Kayı,
I wish that...

303
00:39:16,134 --> 00:39:20,774
...you will not forget whose position
we are choosing someone.

304
00:39:20,774 --> 00:39:25,824
But I still want to remind it.

305
00:39:29,158 --> 00:39:33,158
The late Ertuğrul Ghazi...

306
00:39:33,158 --> 00:39:36,598
...didn't rule like a bey...

307
00:39:39,298 --> 00:39:44,568
...Ertuğrul Ghazi ruled like a sultan.

308
00:39:46,272 --> 00:39:50,272
He didn't say that he didn't
have soldiers...

309
00:39:50,272 --> 00:39:54,922
...that he can't do it with
a few ghazis...

310
00:39:56,018 --> 00:40:02,628
...he said that he ruled the most
noble tribe of Oghuzs.

311
00:40:06,272 --> 00:40:08,862
He ruled that way.

312
00:40:15,669 --> 00:40:19,090
The beys of Kayı...

313
00:40:19,090 --> 00:40:24,710
...the flag of Kayı can't be lowered
from where Ertuğrul Ghazi raised it.

314
00:40:26,267 --> 00:40:31,187
A bey who doesn't
trust in...

315
00:40:31,187 --> 00:40:35,187
...himself or in his tribe...

316
00:40:35,215 --> 00:40:41,795
...who is afraid of freedom,
who bows to Rums or Mongols...

317
00:40:43,733 --> 00:40:47,293
...can't rule this tribe.

318
00:40:47,297 --> 00:40:52,507
This should be known, and decisions
should be made based on this.

319
00:40:58,492 --> 00:41:00,362
Dündar Bey.

320
00:41:01,867 --> 00:41:05,867
You are the first to speak.
Tell us.

321
00:41:11,122 --> 00:41:15,772
Bamsı Bey is right.

322
00:41:18,231 --> 00:41:24,781
Three nephews of mine and I are
candidates.

323
00:41:29,690 --> 00:41:38,040
I want to give up on my claim and
support one of those three brothers.

324
00:41:40,525 --> 00:41:48,585
But I don't know which
one will I pick.

325
00:41:53,816 --> 00:42:00,916
Whichever I choose, I'll hurt the others,
I said.

326
00:42:01,340 --> 00:42:05,340
And by doing the most appropriate...

327
00:42:05,340 --> 00:42:09,800
...I held my right...

328
00:42:11,923 --> 00:42:17,573
...and voted for myself.

329
00:42:17,573 --> 00:42:21,413
I'm a candidate.

330
00:42:28,533 --> 00:42:32,073
Thank you, Dündar Bey.

331
00:42:44,871 --> 00:42:48,631
Sülemiş Bey. It's your turn.

332
00:42:48,631 --> 00:42:52,631
I see the future of the Kayı...

333
00:42:52,631 --> 00:42:56,631
...in the late Ertuğrul Ghazi's
son, Osman Bey.

334
00:42:59,965 --> 00:43:03,965
My candidate is Osman Bey.

335
00:43:16,176 --> 00:43:18,596
Thank you.

336
00:43:26,425 --> 00:43:30,915
Bala, my girl, I didn't like the color of
the fabrics.

337
00:43:30,915 --> 00:43:33,365
Don't worry, mother.

338
00:43:34,812 --> 00:43:39,572
Just like that, Targun, my girl.
Kayı women should always be working.

339
00:43:39,572 --> 00:43:41,732
You'll learn too.

340
00:43:41,732 --> 00:43:45,242
-Of course, I will.
-Well.

341
00:43:50,227 --> 00:43:54,427
Lena, you are acting weird today.
What's wrong?

342
00:43:57,213 --> 00:44:04,253
Am I acting weird, Hazal Hatun? As the
meeting day came closer, you turned weider.

343
00:44:05,054 --> 00:44:09,884
I'm excited that Savcı Bey will win.

344
00:44:10,545 --> 00:44:13,675
You are a bit too excited.

345
00:44:22,930 --> 00:44:28,820
I'm excited because we will win...

346
00:44:28,820 --> 00:44:32,820
...but why are they happy?

347
00:44:32,820 --> 00:44:36,820
Are they excited for losing, I wonder?

348
00:44:41,539 --> 00:44:46,699
Mother, don't hold me back.
Let me cut her tongue.

349
00:44:46,699 --> 00:44:50,699
Or let me stitch it so that she
can never speak again.

350
00:44:52,941 --> 00:44:56,941
Aygül, why is the hurry, my girl?

351
00:44:57,328 --> 00:45:01,328
What will she do when Osman
becomes the bey?

352
00:45:01,328 --> 00:45:06,018
She will sit and eat her tongue
bit by bit.

353
00:45:17,333 --> 00:45:22,053
Well, what do they say...

354
00:45:23,445 --> 00:45:27,445
...hope is the bread of the poor...

355
00:45:27,445 --> 00:45:30,525
...they say.

356
00:45:38,686 --> 00:45:42,686
-Bala!
-Aygül! Aygül!

357
00:45:42,819 --> 00:45:47,689
Aygül, stop!
Aygül, stop!

358
00:45:50,392 --> 00:45:52,212
Aygül!

359
00:45:52,417 --> 00:45:54,127
Aygül!

360
00:45:54,707 --> 00:45:58,707
Enough, enough!

361
00:46:00,704 --> 00:46:05,264
-Enough!
-Aygül!

362
00:46:06,395 --> 00:46:08,735
Aygül, come with us.

363
00:46:12,085 --> 00:46:14,165
Aygül!

364
00:47:29,310 --> 00:47:34,850
So, Targun, my girl. Tell us, you are
silent. Are you all right?

365
00:47:34,850 --> 00:47:40,980
I'm fine, Selcan Hatun. Thank you.
I'm waiting for the results, like everyone else.

366
00:47:58,195 --> 00:48:02,815
Soon, my girl.
Inshallah. Soon.

367
00:48:17,579 --> 00:48:23,439
-Sinan Bey, it's your turn.
-Thank you.

368
00:48:24,764 --> 00:48:31,374
My vote is for Dündar Bey, who I believe
that will act by his mind.

369
00:48:33,734 --> 00:48:36,234
Thank you.

370
00:48:41,951 --> 00:48:44,151
Thank you.

371
00:48:51,843 --> 00:48:57,393
Gündüz Bey, tell us.
It's your turn.

372
00:49:06,154 --> 00:49:10,154
I won't act like my uncle.

373
00:49:13,050 --> 00:49:17,410
I won't mind who gets upset.

374
00:49:21,084 --> 00:49:24,074
The future of the Kayı...

375
00:49:26,311 --> 00:49:30,311
...it's obvious who has
the future of the Kayı.

376
00:49:30,904 --> 00:49:34,904
He who conquered Kulucahisar twice...

377
00:49:35,790 --> 00:49:39,230
...he who saved Söğüt...

378
00:49:44,128 --> 00:49:46,348
...he who...

379
00:49:51,218 --> 00:49:53,878
...saved my uncle and
my brother...

380
00:49:55,167 --> 00:49:59,167
...from Nikola...

381
00:49:59,338 --> 00:50:02,478
...is the bey of the Kayıs.

382
00:50:11,478 --> 00:50:16,228
I'm Gündüz Bey.
I give up on my claim.

383
00:50:18,749 --> 00:50:25,919
I give my vote for my brother Osman,
who deserves to be the bey of the Kayı.

384
00:50:37,011 --> 00:50:41,831
Gündüz Bey, thank you.

385
00:50:43,915 --> 00:50:47,385
Cafer Bey, tell us.

386
00:50:47,385 --> 00:50:51,625
-My vote is for Dündar Bey.
-Thank you.

387
00:50:52,129 --> 00:50:55,799
Thank you. Thank you.

388
00:51:04,132 --> 00:51:06,712
Osman Bey.

389
00:51:07,472 --> 00:51:11,472
It's your turn now.
Tell us.

390
00:51:16,395 --> 00:51:19,435
My words are on...

391
00:51:20,913 --> 00:51:24,913
...the walls of Kulucahisar.

392
00:51:26,225 --> 00:51:32,075
And it will be on the walls of
İnegöl and Larhisar.

393
00:51:32,743 --> 00:51:38,933
My intentions are clear.
I'll conquer distant lands...

394
00:51:38,933 --> 00:51:42,313
...and I'll make the Kayı strong.

395
00:51:42,600 --> 00:51:45,950
And it is obvious what I need
for this...

396
00:51:46,851 --> 00:51:50,711
...and who I vote for.

397
00:52:00,270 --> 00:52:03,890
Thank you, Osman Bey.

398
00:52:04,441 --> 00:52:10,851
Now, Dündar Bey has three votes...

399
00:52:11,140 --> 00:52:15,140
...and Osman Bey has three votes.

400
00:52:21,975 --> 00:52:25,975
Sevindik Bey, who do you vote for?

401
00:52:26,999 --> 00:52:30,809
I vote for Dündar Bey.

402
00:52:32,435 --> 00:52:35,355
Thank you.

403
00:52:39,319 --> 00:52:46,239
Thank you.
Davud Bey, tell us.

404
00:52:49,310 --> 00:52:56,760
My vote is as obvious as
Osman Bey's.

405
00:52:57,841 --> 00:53:01,841
For Osman Bey to accomplish
what...

406
00:53:01,841 --> 00:53:05,231
...he said that he will...

407
00:53:05,231 --> 00:53:08,841
...my vote is for Osman Bey

408
00:53:13,609 --> 00:53:17,609
Thank you, Davud Bey.
Thank you.

409
00:53:20,147 --> 00:53:25,907
İdris Bey, it's your turn.
Who do you vote for?

410
00:53:28,328 --> 00:53:34,168
My vote is for Dündar Bey, who I trust
in his experience and wit.

411
00:53:34,779 --> 00:53:40,449
I want him to be the Bey of the Kayıs.

412
00:53:42,743 --> 00:53:44,403
Thank you.

413
00:53:46,499 --> 00:53:48,749
Thank you, İdris Bey.

414
00:53:53,190 --> 00:54:01,120
Beys of the Kayı. Dündar Bey has
five votes, Osman Bey has four votes.

415
00:54:07,479 --> 00:54:13,089
Two votes are left...

416
00:54:13,089 --> 00:54:18,697
...so, it is impossible for Gündüz Bey
or Savcı Bey to get elected.

417
00:54:27,300 --> 00:54:34,020
My vote is for, obviously...

418
00:54:35,593 --> 00:54:38,613
...Osman Bey.

419
00:54:40,981 --> 00:54:44,981
Now, the votes are equal.

420
00:54:45,152 --> 00:54:50,252
Savcı Bey, it's your turn.

421
00:54:51,611 --> 00:54:58,001
What you will say will determine
the bey of the Kayı.

422
00:55:13,520 --> 00:55:18,230
Look at this brother of mine...

423
00:55:19,372 --> 00:55:24,062
...who steps over me...

424
00:55:24,361 --> 00:55:30,211
...who shakes me off...

425
00:55:33,914 --> 00:55:39,784
...who hits me,
who shouts at me...

426
00:55:39,784 --> 00:55:45,237
...who tells me to back off.
My brother.

427
00:55:47,975 --> 00:55:52,455
Now, am I...

428
00:55:52,781 --> 00:55:56,781
...supposed to give my vote
for him..

429
00:55:57,540 --> 00:55:59,920
...and elect him?

430
00:56:07,120 --> 00:56:14,150
And my uncle.
Only he supported me on this cause...

431
00:56:14,523 --> 00:56:21,333
...told me that he supported me,
he saw me worthy of the position.

432
00:56:26,183 --> 00:56:30,323
Now, can I...

433
00:56:30,923 --> 00:56:35,891
...look directly into his eyes....

434
00:56:37,485 --> 00:56:40,875
...and choose someone else?

435
00:56:43,288 --> 00:56:48,628
Can I let someone else be the bey?

436
00:56:54,229 --> 00:56:58,229
I can't deceive anyone...

437
00:56:58,463 --> 00:57:03,623
...looking directly into their eyes...

438
00:57:04,050 --> 00:57:08,620
...but my uncle can.

439
00:57:18,723 --> 00:57:23,843
Now look at my uncle
who lied to me,...

440
00:57:24,620 --> 00:57:28,620
....looking
directly into my eyes...

441
00:57:28,824 --> 00:57:33,224
...who deceived me,
who stabbed me on my back!

442
00:57:42,515 --> 00:57:49,085
My nephew, maybe it's a misunderstanding.

443
00:57:49,470 --> 00:57:54,540
-Of course, I--
-So, you want to be the Bey?

444
00:57:55,571 --> 00:57:58,821
So, you want to be the bey, uncle?

445
00:58:01,251 --> 00:58:07,191
So, you talked to some people secretly
to convince them.

446
00:58:07,191 --> 00:58:10,470
Savcı! Know what you say!

447
00:58:10,616 --> 00:58:13,856
Know what you say!

448
00:58:14,036 --> 00:58:18,536
Dündar Bey!
Savcı Bey!

449
00:58:20,503 --> 00:58:25,793
This is the election of the bey.

450
00:58:29,872 --> 00:58:34,252
Savcı Bey, sit back.

451
00:58:55,404 --> 00:59:02,264
Savcı Bey, tell us.
Who do you vote for?

452
00:59:02,296 --> 00:59:07,996
The bey of the Kayı will
be determined by your word.

453
00:59:32,929 --> 00:59:37,429
Then, then...

454
00:59:37,566 --> 00:59:41,436
...everyone should listen to me well...

455
00:59:43,017 --> 00:59:47,017
...I rather have a
knife on my neck...

456
00:59:47,407 --> 00:59:52,077
...than a neck on my back.

457
00:59:53,550 --> 01:00:00,340
...I rather the one who roars to myself,
than the one who hisses behind my back.

458
01:00:02,694 --> 01:00:09,564
I rather have some dreamer
ruin the future of the Kayı...

459
01:00:12,330 --> 01:00:18,260
...than a liar decaying it to dust.

460
01:00:25,200 --> 01:00:27,360
I...

461
01:00:29,751 --> 01:00:32,011
...Savcı Bey...

462
01:00:33,832 --> 01:00:36,582
...give my vote for...

463
01:00:44,023 --> 01:00:47,133
...my brother Osman.

464
01:00:57,751 --> 01:01:03,121
Now, whether we'll fight with Mongols
or Rums...

465
01:01:03,121 --> 01:01:07,121
...or both...

466
01:01:08,812 --> 01:01:12,132
...will be decided by him.

467
01:01:17,499 --> 01:01:21,499
We should die but...

468
01:01:23,540 --> 01:01:26,980
...shouldn't crawl.

469
01:01:34,071 --> 01:01:39,861
From now on, with the
votes of the beys...

470
01:01:40,653 --> 01:01:46,923
...Süleyman Shah's son Ertuğrul Ghazi's
son Osman Bey...

471
01:01:48,348 --> 01:01:52,948
...is the new bey of the Kayı tribe.

472
01:01:52,948 --> 01:01:57,208
May Allah make him victorious.

473
01:01:58,046 --> 01:01:59,396
Amin.

474
01:02:19,381 --> 01:02:21,881
Wait there, uncle!

475
01:02:39,181 --> 01:02:42,901
A bey can't be elected like this!

476
01:02:43,523 --> 01:02:49,753
I'll never accept the title which
is gained like this.

477
01:02:52,307 --> 01:02:58,877
It's apparent that some people
are bought by gold.

478
01:03:03,336 --> 01:03:08,996
And some were promised
for the title.

479
01:03:11,075 --> 01:03:14,815
But they were deceived.

480
01:03:16,336 --> 01:03:22,296
Beys, we are electing a bey of Kayı!

481
01:03:22,601 --> 01:03:30,211
A bey of Kayı is the embodiment
of the will of the people.

482
01:03:33,249 --> 01:03:37,619
Put your hand to your heart.

483
01:03:39,101 --> 01:03:44,751
Can an election be like this?

484
01:03:45,139 --> 01:03:49,389
And the other votes for someone else
because he is mad at the other.

485
01:03:52,197 --> 01:03:57,767
Someone who accept to be elected like
this, can't rule the Kayıs.

486
01:03:59,200 --> 01:04:01,850
And he shouldn't!

487
01:04:09,178 --> 01:04:16,208
When a bey of Kayı gets elected,
when our children ask us, what will we say?

488
01:04:16,839 --> 01:04:20,839
Tell us, what will we say?

489
01:04:21,540 --> 01:04:25,540
Is this the foundation of the
state that we will form?

490
01:04:25,540 --> 01:04:30,480
Is this the first work of the generation
that dreams of great conquests?

491
01:04:33,432 --> 01:04:37,432
Is this our cause?
Tell me.

492
01:04:57,932 --> 01:05:00,172
I...

493
01:05:01,340 --> 01:05:04,350
...Ertuğrul Ghazi's son...

494
01:05:05,031 --> 01:05:08,101
...Osman Bey.

495
01:05:08,335 --> 01:05:14,005
For the state that I will form,
for the cities that I will conquer...

496
01:05:14,615 --> 01:05:19,835
...for the great civilization that
I await...

497
01:05:20,726 --> 01:05:27,026
...I want you to choose me because
I am worthy.

498
01:05:42,046 --> 01:05:44,566
Bamsı Bey.

499
01:05:47,098 --> 01:05:50,388
Votes should be recounted.

500
01:06:05,618 --> 01:06:08,358
Thank you, my valiant.

501
01:06:13,926 --> 01:06:16,086
Beys.

502
01:06:16,789 --> 01:06:18,899
Let's do it.

503
01:06:51,608 --> 01:06:55,608
Now, this is the situation.

504
01:06:57,012 --> 01:07:01,012
Those who vote for Osman Bey...

505
01:07:02,266 --> 01:07:05,196
...should raise their hands.

506
01:07:55,611 --> 01:07:58,021
Now it's done.

507
01:08:01,214 --> 01:08:03,554
May it bring good.

508
01:08:09,803 --> 01:08:12,283
Where are you going to, uncle?

509
01:08:14,480 --> 01:08:17,320
What is the hurry?

510
01:08:19,064 --> 01:08:23,064
Don't you have a duty to hand over?

511
01:08:23,903 --> 01:08:27,903
What is it?
What duty?

512
01:08:30,225 --> 01:08:37,565
Aren't you the governor of Söğüt
that got attacked twice...

513
01:08:37,946 --> 01:08:46,356
...and that you were incapable to defend
at first, and left at second.

514
01:08:47,779 --> 01:08:52,339
-Yes, I am.
-Not anymore.

515
01:09:00,584 --> 01:09:04,094
I resign you.

516
01:09:14,894 --> 01:09:20,334
If you allow me, may I get out...

517
01:09:20,334 --> 01:09:22,134
...Osman Bey.

518
01:09:22,441 --> 01:09:24,671
Leave in peace.

519
01:09:44,477 --> 01:09:48,027
And about you, brother...

520
01:09:49,060 --> 01:09:54,680
...as the leader of the alps,
during the conquest of Kulucahisar...

521
01:09:55,398 --> 01:10:00,678
...while Söğüt was
getting saved, where were you?

522
01:10:06,103 --> 01:10:09,723
Tell us, where were you, brother?

523
01:10:15,375 --> 01:10:19,375
If you are in silence...

524
01:10:21,164 --> 01:10:25,164
...if you accept your incapability...

525
01:10:26,775 --> 01:10:32,045
...then, I resign
you from your duty.

526
01:10:38,979 --> 01:10:42,979
Very well, brother.

527
01:10:45,250 --> 01:10:48,010
Very well.

528
01:10:50,012 --> 01:10:55,522
If you allow me, Osman Bey.

529
01:11:01,402 --> 01:11:04,912
As you want, Savcı Bey.

530
01:11:28,562 --> 01:11:31,062
Osman...

531
01:11:31,487 --> 01:11:34,387
...my dark Osman.

532
01:11:35,500 --> 01:11:38,430
Osman Bey...

533
01:11:38,643 --> 01:11:44,813
...now, the new bey of the Kayıs,
Osman Bey.

534
01:12:05,062 --> 01:12:07,712
Bamsı Bey.

535
01:13:54,237 --> 01:13:57,147
O' people!

536
01:13:59,762 --> 01:14:03,762
The election is over!

537
01:14:08,540 --> 01:14:12,540
The new bey of the Kayıs...

538
01:14:24,528 --> 01:14:28,528
...is Ertuğrul Ghazi's son...

539
01:14:40,543 --> 01:14:43,983
...Osman Bey!

540
01:14:59,416 --> 01:15:01,726
Brother!

541
01:15:11,550 --> 01:15:14,390
Thank Allah!

542
01:15:16,070 --> 01:15:24,320
The new bey of the Kayıs is
Ertuğrul Ghazi's son, Osman Bey!

543
01:15:30,283 --> 01:15:37,723
The new bey of the Kayıs is
Ertuğrul Ghazi's son, Osman Bey!

544
01:15:38,565 --> 01:15:42,565
God damn it!

545
01:15:42,953 --> 01:15:50,443
Dündar was going to play with Savcı,
it seems that Savcı played him first.

546
01:16:00,334 --> 01:16:03,764
If you allow me.

547
01:16:03,862 --> 01:16:07,862
Go to your bey.

548
01:16:09,429 --> 01:16:11,879
Come on.

549
01:16:14,784 --> 01:16:18,784
Thank Allah, Bala.
Thank Allah Thank Allah.

550
01:16:19,856 --> 01:16:25,166
-Thank Allah.
-Mother Gonca, thank Allah.

551
01:16:41,017 --> 01:16:44,197
Thank Allah.

552
01:16:44,331 --> 01:16:46,371
Osman Bey...

553
01:16:47,082 --> 01:16:50,772
...is much more powerful now.

554
01:17:14,557 --> 01:17:24,537
The new bey of the Kayıs is
Ertuğrul Ghazi's son, Osman Bey!

555
01:17:30,784 --> 01:17:36,954
So, you don't want the war to end, huh?
So, you want to be destroyed by the Mongols?

556
01:17:37,024 --> 01:17:39,714
So you want to die, huh?

557
01:17:40,353 --> 01:17:46,113
I'll drown you in your blood!

558
01:17:54,984 --> 01:18:00,074
Abdurrahman Ghazi, tell me what you will.
I'm curious.

559
01:18:08,511 --> 01:18:11,431
What's this?

560
01:18:11,893 --> 01:18:15,243
What's this, Abdurrahman Ghazi?

561
01:18:17,059 --> 01:18:21,629
This is the will of our Ertuğrul Ghazi.

562
01:18:26,542 --> 01:18:29,752
My Ertuğrul Bey...

563
01:18:29,931 --> 01:18:33,711
With the name of Allah.

564
01:18:49,248 --> 01:18:55,148
Abdurrahman Ghazi,
he wants Osman to be the bey...

565
01:18:55,423 --> 01:19:02,363
...that's what it says.
Why didn't he say that?

566
01:19:02,363 --> 01:19:07,033
-I asked that question, Bamsı Bey
-What did he say?

567
01:19:07,033 --> 01:19:11,033
He said that he will follow our
holy prophet.

568
01:19:11,098 --> 01:19:15,038
He didn't leave an heir, he said.

569
01:19:15,814 --> 01:19:20,544
I want him to be elected by the beys,
by the people, he said.

570
01:19:20,544 --> 01:19:24,544
He wanted Osman to be elected
with the support of the people.

571
01:19:24,544 --> 01:19:29,774
He didn't want anyone...

572
01:19:29,874 --> 01:19:33,624
...to stand against him and say ''You
wouldn't be the bey if Ertuğrul Bey...

573
01:19:33,624 --> 01:19:35,244
...hadn't told us so!''

574
01:19:39,192 --> 01:19:43,192
Brother, if that was the case...

575
01:19:43,788 --> 01:19:49,788
...why did he put it to his will?
-As a measure, brother. As a measure.

576
01:19:50,875 --> 01:19:54,875
If someone makes a scheme...

577
01:19:54,875 --> 01:19:58,685
...you will reveal it
and show to the beys, he said.

578
01:19:58,739 --> 01:20:02,739
So, Osman will get his right, he said.

579
01:20:03,663 --> 01:20:07,663
Abdurrahman Ghazi...

580
01:20:08,698 --> 01:20:13,418
...his will isn't just about that.

581
01:20:28,238 --> 01:20:31,428
You have visitors, sir.

582
01:20:45,468 --> 01:20:48,478
Petros.

583
01:20:49,672 --> 01:20:52,252
I know you.

584
01:20:55,392 --> 01:21:02,532
What are you doing in my castle?
And what are you after? May I learn?

585
01:21:04,040 --> 01:21:09,210
Is this how you greet an old friend,
Nikola?

586
01:21:09,605 --> 01:21:12,085
A friend?

587
01:21:14,182 --> 01:21:17,562
A friend? A friend, huh?

588
01:21:18,294 --> 01:21:22,734
Osman had hurt you a bit, it seems.

589
01:21:25,183 --> 01:21:27,793
Petros.

590
01:21:31,686 --> 01:21:37,876
You are in the lands of the empire.
Know your place.

591
01:21:39,540 --> 01:21:45,090
After all, we don't look kindly
to the men of the pope.

592
01:21:46,524 --> 01:21:52,404
And also, the people who pillaged
Constantinople are less favorable...

593
01:21:52,404 --> 01:21:56,374
...for us than the people
who took Kulucahisar.

594
01:21:58,394 --> 01:22:02,214
The enemy of my enemy...

595
01:22:03,345 --> 01:22:06,515
...is my friend.

596
01:22:13,257 --> 01:22:20,327
In here, I decide who is a friend
and who is an enemy.

597
01:22:20,717 --> 01:22:27,267
Now, why are you here?

598
01:22:51,994 --> 01:22:55,994
Pope Nicholaus Quartus?

599
01:22:59,382 --> 01:23:02,882
What does your holy pope...

600
01:23:03,120 --> 01:23:07,200
...want from Osman, Petros?
-Same thing with you.

601
01:23:07,644 --> 01:23:09,904
He wants to end him.

602
01:23:10,706 --> 01:23:18,836
Petros. Why would your holy pope
be so interested in someone so far away?

603
01:23:18,961 --> 01:23:24,231
He doesn't want him to get closer one day.
He wants him to stay away forever.

604
01:23:24,231 --> 01:23:27,931
And if possible, he wants him to die
as soon as possible.

605
01:23:28,463 --> 01:23:32,463
So, the pope has ears in Söğüt.

606
01:23:34,618 --> 01:23:42,188
As he has in everywhere. Turkic armies
should never unite under him.

607
01:23:42,213 --> 01:23:45,993
Because that would
be so dangerous.

608
01:23:45,993 --> 01:23:53,083
That would be so dangerous that we can't
trust in you and sit at our homes then.

609
01:23:55,136 --> 01:23:59,136
We have to support you.

610
01:23:59,558 --> 01:24:04,988
Gentlemen, to work around here,
ears around enough.

611
01:24:13,650 --> 01:24:16,860
You need weapons.

612
01:24:16,978 --> 01:24:20,978
You know it well that
we have the effective weapons.

613
01:24:21,072 --> 01:24:25,072
The ears you hid,
I mean the weapons...

614
01:24:25,842 --> 01:24:29,112
...should stay
where they are.

615
01:24:30,980 --> 01:24:34,980
Because I don't need them.

616
01:24:36,563 --> 01:24:40,913
So, you don't need us?
All right.

617
01:24:41,084 --> 01:24:47,084
-Where is your right-hand Flatyos?
-Haven't your ears in Söğüt told you?

618
01:24:47,084 --> 01:24:54,234
They have, wouldn't they? We even started
our preparations to save him but...

619
01:24:55,788 --> 01:25:03,768
-Saving him from the Kayı Tribe?
-As a sign of our good intentions.

620
01:25:06,238 --> 01:25:10,238
But if you don't need us.

621
01:25:12,863 --> 01:25:14,933
Very well.

622
01:25:16,809 --> 01:25:19,429
Let's do it like this.

623
01:25:23,578 --> 01:25:28,468
If you can save Flatyos from
the Kayı Tribe, safe and sound.

624
01:25:28,777 --> 01:25:32,807
Then, I'll see what I can
do with you.

625
01:25:33,375 --> 01:25:35,155
Is that all right?

626
01:25:40,655 --> 01:25:44,655
When Flatyos returns to your castle,
safe and sound...

627
01:25:44,793 --> 01:25:49,403
...you'll see what we can do.
Then...

628
01:25:49,519 --> 01:25:53,519
...you'll learn how to show respect.

629
01:25:58,631 --> 01:26:01,341
Matmazel.

630
01:26:01,715 --> 01:26:05,715
Stay with us for the dinner!

631
01:26:19,354 --> 01:26:22,734
How considerate they are, Helen.

632
01:26:22,734 --> 01:26:26,454
They took all that way to help me.

633
01:26:28,504 --> 01:26:32,104
Do you think that I look that dumb?

634
01:26:32,238 --> 01:26:34,918
What are their real intentions?

635
01:26:36,033 --> 01:26:39,813
They are after a greater hunt.

636
01:26:40,059 --> 01:26:43,229
I have to find that out.

637
01:26:43,423 --> 01:26:47,013
We are partners in killing Osman.

638
01:26:47,102 --> 01:26:51,912
And about the great hunt,
I like great hunts.

639
01:26:54,452 --> 01:27:00,982
You do. Should I sent
men after them?

640
01:27:01,060 --> 01:27:05,060
Helen, dear Helen.
Shouldn't you have acted...

641
01:27:05,060 --> 01:27:08,640
...already, thinking that
I would like that?

642
01:27:09,284 --> 01:27:11,974
Helen?

643
01:27:24,225 --> 01:27:27,895
Things will go crazy.

644
01:27:30,091 --> 01:27:33,891
A lot.

645
01:28:29,090 --> 01:28:33,090
Existence and nothingness...

646
01:28:33,090 --> 01:28:39,000
...the truth is unity,
and unity is the state.

647
01:28:40,712 --> 01:28:44,712
Hail our bey!

648
01:28:47,399 --> 01:28:53,189
This gate is the gate of the state!
It can't be forced!

649
01:28:53,189 --> 01:28:58,939
It can't get broken by wits!
It requires a heart!

650
01:28:59,208 --> 01:29:04,748
Our state shall live long!

651
01:29:04,752 --> 01:29:08,972
Our state shall live long!

652
01:29:10,668 --> 01:29:18,438
The sword you're carrying is not yours!
The horse you are riding is not yours!

653
01:29:19,001 --> 01:29:23,251
The throne you are sitting on is not yours!

654
01:29:23,656 --> 01:29:28,576
Time is not yours!
Your position is not yours!

655
01:29:29,086 --> 01:29:35,337
The path you are taking is not yours!
Your dreams is not yours!

656
01:29:36,835 --> 01:29:43,442
- They're all for our community!
- Thanks to Turkish people!

657
01:29:43,922 --> 01:30:09,782
Long live Osman Bey!

658
01:30:32,168 --> 01:30:40,078
Osman Bey.
This Beyhood is Oghuz Khan's tradition.

659
01:30:41,602 --> 01:30:47,112
This is Alparslan's soul,
Kilicarslan's faith...

660
01:30:47,117 --> 01:30:53,737
Süleiman Shah's blood, Ertugrul Ghazi's
heritage.

661
01:30:57,975 --> 01:31:01,948
May your Beyhood be blessed.

662
01:31:01,948 --> 01:31:09,278
May your Beyhood be blessed!

663
01:31:10,274 --> 01:31:14,294
Thank you Bamsı Bey.
Thank you.

664
01:31:17,968 --> 01:31:22,118
Osman Bey, connect with the tradition.

665
01:31:22,399 --> 01:31:27,442
You shall be wise, you shall listen to
your heart.

666
01:31:27,442 --> 01:31:33,638
You shall carry on the tradition!
You shall carry on our state!

667
01:31:33,638 --> 01:31:38,515
You shall lead our people!

668
01:31:38,515 --> 01:31:42,495
From now on state is yours.

669
01:31:42,593 --> 01:31:48,833
Long live our state!

670
01:32:11,373 --> 01:32:18,053
Osman Bey, son of Ertugrul Ghazi.
Do not forget the oath you took.

671
01:32:19,000 --> 01:32:27,770
Always remember you are just a creature
of the creator who is the owner of...

672
01:32:27,786 --> 01:32:32,766
doomsday, the Lord of the universe.

673
01:33:15,730 --> 01:33:21,310
Osman Bey, this sword is
Suleiman Shah's son...

674
01:33:21,933 --> 01:33:25,423
Ertugrul Ghazi's sword.

675
01:33:26,376 --> 01:33:33,486
You are going to carry it now. You are
going to be the commander of Ghazis.

676
01:33:33,822 --> 01:33:38,986
May Allah bless you.

677
01:33:38,986 --> 01:33:41,666
Amen!

678
01:34:29,236 --> 01:34:35,936
Osman Bey, you shall carry our banner to
the castles...

679
01:34:35,983 --> 01:34:41,115
and other lands, other cities.

680
01:34:41,115 --> 01:34:43,095
Amen!

681
01:35:24,159 --> 01:35:28,769
Thank you my Lord.
Thank you.

682
01:35:54,284 --> 01:36:01,964
O' the almighty, filling our hearts
full of faith...

683
01:36:03,487 --> 01:36:08,837
with Allah's all 99 name.

684
01:36:20,188 --> 01:36:24,168
From now on, I took over
the throne.

685
01:36:26,556 --> 01:36:31,266
I took my sword.

686
01:36:32,693 --> 01:36:37,843
Now, it's time to unite...

687
01:36:38,640 --> 01:36:45,320
unite and be a state!

688
01:36:52,821 --> 01:36:59,771
From now on, we are going to celebrate
lots of conquests we're going to carry out!

689
01:37:03,586 --> 01:37:09,116
New conquests will bring new victories...

690
01:37:09,775 --> 01:37:14,315
and Kayı's banner is going to land on
the other lands!

691
01:37:14,906 --> 01:37:17,116
Inshallah.

692
01:37:18,896 --> 01:37:23,766
Be fair, you are going to be
treated in a fair way.

693
01:37:25,145 --> 01:37:29,455
Try hard, you are going to
find help.

694
01:37:30,716 --> 01:37:35,506
Be patient, you are going to
be freed.

695
01:37:40,256 --> 01:37:46,466
My Ghazis, my Ahis, my sisters...

696
01:37:47,905 --> 01:37:50,145
my brothers!

697
01:37:51,831 --> 01:37:55,121
We are going to found a different state.

698
01:37:57,524 --> 01:38:03,644
We are going to leave our children
our effort...

699
01:38:04,151 --> 01:38:08,411
our passion, our justice.

700
01:38:08,457 --> 01:38:12,317
Until...
Until...

701
01:38:13,187 --> 01:38:17,747
We spread our names and banner
to the four winds...

702
01:38:18,920 --> 01:38:25,500
and be the hope for oppressed
all around the world...

703
01:38:26,100 --> 01:38:32,880
Let them be hopeful, because we're coming!

704
01:38:38,086 --> 01:38:39,886
Don't be jealous.

705
01:38:41,943 --> 01:38:44,573
Be gratitude.

706
01:38:44,929 --> 01:38:48,779
Don't be lazy.
Be hardworking.

707
01:38:51,707 --> 01:38:55,067
Don't be affected.
Be effective.

708
01:38:56,215 --> 01:38:58,245
Don't be tricky!

709
01:39:01,028 --> 01:39:03,538
Be honourable.

710
01:39:06,545 --> 01:39:11,805
Judicious judges,
Fredom fighter soldiers...

711
01:39:14,435 --> 01:39:19,885
and merchants with work ethics.
We need these people.

712
01:39:21,783 --> 01:39:29,473
We need to write grand books,
we need to produce grand ideas...

713
01:39:30,593 --> 01:39:34,553
we need to be grand.
We need to build grand...

714
01:39:34,895 --> 01:39:38,725
grand madrasahs.

715
01:39:39,607 --> 01:39:44,187
And live long!

716
01:39:53,273 --> 01:39:59,323
This is what history wants our people...

717
01:40:00,550 --> 01:40:02,690
to do so.

718
01:40:03,842 --> 01:40:10,182
No doubt that this is the right way.

719
01:40:10,993 --> 01:40:28,623
Allah-u Akbar!
(Allah is the greatest!)

720
01:41:31,746 --> 01:41:37,446
To the to be Sultan of ours...

721
01:41:37,530 --> 01:41:40,868
Al-fatiha!

722
01:41:40,868 --> 01:41:45,418
My Allah, grant our master...

723
01:41:45,522 --> 01:41:51,142
help our master Muhammed and his ummah.

724
01:42:06,945 --> 01:42:12,075
"I seek help from Allah to protect me
against banished devil"

725
01:42:12,170 --> 01:42:17,340
"In the name of Allah, the merciful,
compassionate"

726
01:42:17,391 --> 01:42:22,695
So, know ˹well, O Prophet,˺ that there is no god
˹worthy of worship˺ except Allah. (Muhammad 47:19)

727
01:42:22,695 --> 01:42:30,385
La ilahe illallah.
(there is no god except for Allah)

728
01:42:30,966 --> 01:42:39,706
-Arabic hymn-

729
01:43:11,889 --> 01:43:16,359
Whenever you see a heartbroken one...

730
01:43:17,955 --> 01:43:22,905
be balm for them.

731
01:43:26,237 --> 01:43:30,727
Be the helper of oppressed...

732
01:43:30,816 --> 01:43:35,096
when they are stranded.

733
01:43:36,115 --> 01:43:38,115
-his name is glorious-

734
01:43:42,374 --> 01:43:47,044
Our state shall rise...

735
01:43:47,142 --> 01:43:52,842
Our brave men will glorify us.

736
01:43:53,736 --> 01:43:58,786
We run away from the ones...

737
01:43:58,838 --> 01:44:02,755
who seek selfishness.

738
01:44:02,755 --> 01:44:07,355
Oh, oh...

739
01:44:10,959 --> 01:44:16,559
Our prophet was the leader of the
oppressed.

740
01:44:19,729 --> 01:44:23,149
Wander around, search for the oppresseds
to help them...

741
01:44:23,492 --> 01:44:29,902
like Mustafa (prophet Muhammed)

742
01:44:32,895 --> 01:44:40,805
Don't let us be worker of
this mortal world.

743
01:44:41,478 --> 01:44:51,378
So that we can work for afterlife.

744
01:44:54,159 --> 01:44:59,119
Haji Ahmad...

745
01:45:02,505 --> 01:45:09,805
Haji Ahmad died in hamartia.

746
01:45:10,699 --> 01:45:19,959
Oh what a pity, what a longing.

747
01:45:20,333 --> 01:45:26,093
Don't let us die without
remembering your name.

748
01:45:29,677 --> 01:45:34,353
For the sake of almighty trees...

749
01:45:34,353 --> 01:45:40,323
honor us with your power.

750
01:45:40,917 --> 01:45:47,817
We pray, we pray for...

751
01:45:48,325 --> 01:45:53,965
your name.

752
01:45:54,666 --> 01:46:02,706
For your name.

753
01:46:03,408 --> 01:46:10,413
Al-Rahman, al-rahim.
(the merciful, the compassionate)

754
01:46:10,413 --> 01:46:13,543
Illallah!
(ending)

755
01:46:39,422 --> 01:46:43,035
illahu!

756
01:46:43,035 --> 01:46:48,465
Allah Allah!

757
01:46:50,600 --> 01:46:52,770
Beloved Allah!

758
01:46:52,775 --> 01:46:57,523
˹He will also give you˺ another favour
that you long for: help from Allah...

759
01:46:57,523 --> 01:47:02,603
and an imminent victory. ˹ ˹So˺ give good
news ˹O Prophet˺ to the believers.
(As-saf 61:13)

760
01:47:02,661 --> 01:47:10,751
Allah the first, Allah the last, Allah the
evident, Allah the obscure.

761
01:47:10,875 --> 01:47:17,145
There's no God but Allah, and Muhammed
is his messenger.

762
01:47:18,044 --> 01:47:23,734
Evilness shall leave, goodness, shall
arrive.

763
01:47:24,063 --> 01:47:29,020
May Allah grant us happiness.

764
01:47:29,020 --> 01:47:33,670
May rebels be ruined.

765
01:47:34,174 --> 01:47:38,754
Our sins shall be forgiven.

766
01:47:38,830 --> 01:47:42,680
Our last words shall be shahada.

767
01:47:43,151 --> 01:47:47,337
May our Ertugrul Bey Ghazi be blessed.

768
01:47:47,337 --> 01:47:52,837
May he rest in peace.
May our Osman Bey's new role be praised.

769
01:47:53,852 --> 01:47:55,962
May his sword be sharp.

770
01:47:56,640 --> 01:47:59,220
May he be wise.

771
01:48:00,153 --> 01:48:03,163
May he be the conquerer.

772
01:48:03,294 --> 01:48:08,564
May our martyred ones be blessed.

773
01:48:10,130 --> 01:48:15,220
May our state live long.

774
01:48:15,595 --> 01:48:20,585
May our people be happy forever.

775
01:48:21,036 --> 01:48:24,396
May our enemies go down.

776
01:48:24,441 --> 01:48:29,641
- Praying in Arabic -

777
01:48:29,806 --> 01:48:36,256
- Praying in Arabic -

778
01:48:36,690 --> 01:48:41,700
- Praying in Arabic -

779
01:48:42,072 --> 01:48:49,709
- Praying in Arabic -

780
01:48:49,709 --> 01:48:54,309
Ya Allah!

781
01:49:23,785 --> 01:49:26,615
Savcı! Savcı!

782
01:49:26,718 --> 01:49:29,338
How could you do that?

783
01:49:31,960 --> 01:49:33,630
How could you do that?

784
01:49:33,796 --> 01:49:37,796
How could you give the Beyhood to Osman?

785
01:49:39,664 --> 01:49:42,234
Savcı! How?!

786
01:49:45,281 --> 01:49:47,611
You keep shouting.

787
01:49:51,479 --> 01:49:55,479
If you were patient and didn't
change your mind at the last moment...

788
01:49:56,357 --> 01:49:58,237
Beyhood would be yours!

789
01:49:58,924 --> 01:50:03,264
Hatun! Enough.
Now isn't the time. Enough!

790
01:50:04,980 --> 01:50:08,060
My stupid mind! Ah!

791
01:50:10,181 --> 01:50:13,431
How could I trust you?

792
01:50:17,959 --> 01:50:20,449
How could I trust you?

793
01:50:25,204 --> 01:50:27,644
I said enough! Don't you understand? Huh?

794
01:50:27,778 --> 01:50:30,768
Enough! Don't you understand?

795
01:50:31,524 --> 01:50:35,003
Don't you understand!
Don't you understand?

796
01:50:35,093 --> 01:50:39,043
I said enough! Now isn't the time!

797
01:50:39,138 --> 01:50:41,578
Don't you understand?
Tell me!

798
01:50:41,693 --> 01:50:45,243
- Can I come in, my Bey?
- No, tell me!

799
01:50:45,519 --> 01:50:49,819
- Osman Bey is waiting for you.
- Tell him I won't come!

800
01:50:50,019 --> 01:50:53,669
I won't come!
I won't come!

801
01:50:56,060 --> 01:51:00,060
Now, you know you
shouldn't touch an angry man.

802
01:51:04,659 --> 01:51:06,589
Now, you know.

803
01:51:12,738 --> 01:51:14,108
Osman...

804
01:51:15,941 --> 01:51:18,081
- My Bala.
- My Osman.

805
01:51:18,925 --> 01:51:20,445
My Osman Bey.

806
01:51:23,344 --> 01:51:25,934
My Allah accepted my prayers.

807
01:51:26,306 --> 01:51:30,306
My heart wouldn't want
another man as Kayı Bey.

808
01:51:43,195 --> 01:51:44,315
My Bala.

809
01:51:45,392 --> 01:51:49,512
Now, you'll be the head of Kayı Hatuns.

810
01:51:50,981 --> 01:51:52,191
However...

811
01:51:53,271 --> 01:51:55,951
your job more difficult.

812
01:51:56,865 --> 01:51:58,805
Why, my Osman?

813
01:52:03,372 --> 01:52:06,872
I know how to hold
Dündar Bey and Brother Savcı.

814
01:52:07,770 --> 01:52:11,920
However, how will
you hold Hazal and Lena Hatun?

815
01:52:16,443 --> 01:52:20,403
Don't worry, Selcan Hatun will do that.

816
01:52:22,515 --> 01:52:25,655
Listen to Selcan Hatun's advices.

817
01:52:26,718 --> 01:52:29,118
She'll tell you some things tonight.

818
01:52:34,103 --> 01:52:36,273
Osman Bey!

819
01:52:36,949 --> 01:52:39,899
Targun Hatun and İnal Bey
want to come in.

820
01:52:43,285 --> 01:52:45,445
They will say something.

821
01:52:59,524 --> 01:53:01,864
Come in.

822
01:53:19,934 --> 01:53:23,654
- I congratulate your Beyhood.
- Thank you, İnal Bey.

823
01:53:25,843 --> 01:53:26,753
Sit, please.

824
01:53:38,092 --> 01:53:39,852
Aunt Selcan.

825
01:53:42,380 --> 01:53:43,780
My Osman Bey.

826
01:53:44,989 --> 01:53:47,289
Sit, please.

827
01:53:57,362 --> 01:54:00,032
You saved me.

828
01:54:00,555 --> 01:54:02,755
I owe you.

829
01:54:05,544 --> 01:54:10,124
You gave up on your freedom
by not attacking us.

830
01:54:12,357 --> 01:54:16,927
It's our duty to save you.

831
01:54:21,324 --> 01:54:25,324
I heard you'll marry my daughter Targun.

832
01:54:39,675 --> 01:54:43,285
Having a relationship between
Cumans and Kayıs...

833
01:54:45,223 --> 01:54:47,693
is the right thing.

834
01:54:54,850 --> 01:54:57,960
Be our guest tonight too.

835
01:54:58,063 --> 01:54:59,793
We'll talk about it later.

836
01:55:04,621 --> 01:55:05,791
Yes.

837
01:55:11,754 --> 01:55:15,754
We should make a wedding.

838
01:55:15,891 --> 01:55:17,161
Osman Bey.

839
01:55:17,526 --> 01:55:21,126
I talked to my father. I'll be a Muslim.

840
01:55:27,273 --> 01:55:29,683
Are there anything to stop me?

841
01:55:33,876 --> 01:55:35,776
No, of course.

842
01:55:37,218 --> 01:55:39,088
We should hurry.

843
01:55:45,036 --> 01:55:49,036
My Aunt Selcan will teach you...

844
01:55:49,195 --> 01:55:52,175
the Shahada and Islam's basic rules.

845
01:55:53,756 --> 01:55:55,576
Of course.

846
01:55:55,671 --> 01:55:58,001
As long as you want to learn.

847
01:55:58,638 --> 01:56:00,348
I do.

848
01:56:10,041 --> 01:56:12,901
Excuse us, Osman Bey.

849
01:56:13,539 --> 01:56:15,409
Of course.

850
01:56:35,876 --> 01:56:39,066
Targun Hatun is till playing, Osman Bey.

851
01:56:52,266 --> 01:56:56,266
My Bala, Aunt Selcan is going to tell
you something.

852
01:56:56,609 --> 01:57:00,159
I'll go and check the Alps.

853
01:57:07,672 --> 01:57:09,682
Come, daughter.

854
01:57:32,461 --> 01:57:33,711
So...

855
01:57:35,128 --> 01:57:37,098
Savcı.

856
01:57:37,371 --> 01:57:39,221
Yes, Uncle.

857
01:57:39,483 --> 01:57:44,023
So, you prefer Osman.

858
01:57:44,288 --> 01:57:47,768
So, you deceive Beys and use them.

859
01:57:48,346 --> 01:57:52,006
You've deceived me!

860
01:57:52,182 --> 01:57:55,302
You've done things behind my back!

861
01:58:02,128 --> 01:58:05,008
I don't deceive any Bey.

862
01:58:05,588 --> 01:58:09,588
They don't want you to become a Bey, then.

863
01:58:09,929 --> 01:58:13,879
You haven't received any vote.

864
01:58:15,012 --> 01:58:18,332
You haven't been able to say your name.

865
01:58:20,057 --> 01:58:21,567
So...

866
01:58:22,464 --> 01:58:26,544
why did you want to become a Bey?

867
01:58:26,875 --> 01:58:30,185
I had to!

868
01:58:30,668 --> 01:58:34,668
I prevented Osman
endanger the Beyhood.

869
01:58:35,919 --> 01:58:37,339
You?

870
01:58:37,949 --> 01:58:42,219
Why did you want to become a Bey?

871
01:58:43,435 --> 01:58:46,205
It doesn't matter now.

872
01:58:46,695 --> 01:58:48,915
You say Osman will endanger
the Beyhood.

873
01:58:49,439 --> 01:58:51,899
Now, the problem is...

874
01:58:52,224 --> 01:58:56,414
will we stop it or watch it happen?

875
01:58:58,937 --> 01:59:01,837
So, we should move together.

876
01:59:01,992 --> 01:59:04,852
You want me to believe your lies again!

877
01:59:16,216 --> 01:59:19,886
Don't believe if you don't want to.

878
01:59:22,257 --> 01:59:24,007
Do whatever you want.

879
01:59:28,347 --> 01:59:33,727
Then, Geyhatu may cut our heads off.

880
01:59:34,448 --> 01:59:37,448
What will we do
when they capture Kayı's Hatuns...

881
01:59:37,449 --> 01:59:40,689
when they kill Kayı's children...

882
01:59:40,746 --> 01:59:44,746
when they burn your father's tent?

883
01:59:44,987 --> 01:59:49,047
We should unite!

884
01:59:50,109 --> 01:59:54,109
You should've thought about
that before you deceived me.

885
01:59:55,285 --> 01:59:58,765
Before you prevented my Beyhood.

886
01:59:59,383 --> 02:00:03,793
Now, bear the consequences.

887
02:00:19,985 --> 02:00:22,205
My beautiful daughter.

888
02:00:22,423 --> 02:00:25,773
My Osman should've been a Bey, now he is.

889
02:00:25,944 --> 02:00:29,514
You should've been Hatun of Bey, now
you are.

890
02:00:30,069 --> 02:00:34,249
I should've told you some things, here
I am.

891
02:00:38,272 --> 02:00:41,502
My mother.
I'm listening.

892
02:00:41,665 --> 02:00:44,995
You know I will never forget what you say.

893
02:00:45,230 --> 02:00:47,500
Mashaallah.

894
02:00:49,652 --> 02:00:55,092
Bala Hatun, Hatun of Bey, listen to me.

895
02:00:55,445 --> 02:00:58,685
Hatuns of Turk Beys are important.

896
02:00:58,778 --> 02:01:04,068
Hatuns take care of the tent when
their Beys are away.

897
02:01:04,926 --> 02:01:10,516
You'll be Osman's eyes when he is away.

898
02:01:12,086 --> 02:01:15,386
You'll treat everyone mercifully.

899
02:01:15,793 --> 02:01:20,763
Listen to their
complaints carefully, daughter.

900
02:01:21,216 --> 02:01:24,256
Yes, mother. I'll listen to you.

901
02:01:24,553 --> 02:01:25,573
However...

902
02:01:26,742 --> 02:01:30,852
Don't tell your
Bey if you hear bad wishes.

903
02:01:32,347 --> 02:01:35,137
Don't make your Bey' mind busy...

904
02:01:35,137 --> 02:01:38,617
for wishes that are not right.

905
02:01:40,470 --> 02:01:46,180
If someone wants something
right, treat them rightfully.

906
02:01:46,560 --> 02:01:50,560
If someone wants you to be injustice...

907
02:01:51,221 --> 02:01:56,581
reject them and warn them.

908
02:01:56,933 --> 02:01:59,973
Yes, mother. I'll listen to you.

909
02:02:01,443 --> 02:02:05,583
Bala Hatun, daughter of Sheikh
Edebali, Hatun of Bey...

910
02:02:06,572 --> 02:02:11,562
The advice
I give to you aren't right anymore.

911
02:02:11,918 --> 02:02:15,938
You know how to talk, how
to stay silent...

912
02:02:15,938 --> 02:02:19,595
where to walk and where to stop.

913
02:02:19,665 --> 02:02:22,115
Do however you want.

914
02:02:28,081 --> 02:02:29,171
Mother.

915
02:02:29,710 --> 02:02:30,990
Selcan Mother.

916
02:02:31,969 --> 02:02:35,099
- Thank you so much.
- Thank you, daughter.

917
02:02:37,725 --> 02:02:40,715
Are you fine? Tell me.

918
02:02:42,459 --> 02:02:45,639
Yes, mother. Thank Allah.

919
02:02:46,861 --> 02:02:47,971
However...

920
02:02:49,283 --> 02:02:51,873
I don't know what Targun Hatun is up to.

921
02:02:52,113 --> 02:02:54,723
Tell me what should I do.

922
02:03:05,216 --> 02:03:07,386
We'll take our revenge, daughter.

923
02:03:07,821 --> 02:03:12,201
We'll take revenge from those who
did this to us as I promised.

924
02:03:14,076 --> 02:03:16,126
We owe to Osman Bey.

925
02:03:16,221 --> 02:03:21,021
We pay his favors back sooner or later.

926
02:03:21,198 --> 02:03:22,758
Yes father.

927
02:03:22,798 --> 02:03:26,798
I'll be closer to Osman Bey for us.

928
02:03:28,806 --> 02:03:31,506
I'll be the head of my Beylic. (Beyhood)

929
02:03:31,827 --> 02:03:34,277
I'll gather my Alps again.

930
02:03:34,783 --> 02:03:38,783
Our raids will collapse Roman.

931
02:03:39,617 --> 02:03:42,467
I'll destroy them.

932
02:03:42,527 --> 02:03:46,527
I'll help you, father.
I'll be your sharpest sword.

933
02:03:48,009 --> 02:03:50,769
We'll have Kayıs' power.

934
02:03:53,992 --> 02:03:57,312
Are you sure you want to...

935
02:03:57,312 --> 02:04:00,512
marry Osman Bey?

936
02:04:02,552 --> 02:04:06,072
I'll marry him.
I'll be his Hatun.

937
02:04:10,558 --> 02:04:12,168
Do whatever you say.

938
02:04:12,262 --> 02:04:18,032
We'll be relatives with Kayıs.
Kayı and Cuman blood will be mixed.

939
02:04:19,597 --> 02:04:22,757
A new descent will come from you.

940
02:04:23,210 --> 02:04:26,410
My grandchildren will be Beys of Kayıs.

941
02:04:26,745 --> 02:04:30,745
They will be, father.
Don't worry.

942
02:05:13,321 --> 02:05:15,911
I saw them all, son.

943
02:05:16,033 --> 02:05:20,273
I saw you, I saw our Beylic.

944
02:05:21,967 --> 02:05:25,227
I saw horizons.

945
02:05:26,996 --> 02:05:29,816
I saw everything.

946
02:05:30,124 --> 02:05:33,354
Tell me about the others.

947
02:05:34,248 --> 02:05:37,548
The war fire is close.

948
02:05:39,074 --> 02:05:43,344
This fire will burn...

949
02:05:43,796 --> 02:05:47,796
until it is gone.

950
02:05:48,992 --> 02:05:53,322
I won't stop then.

951
02:05:56,662 --> 02:05:59,352
Kayı will grow up.

952
02:06:00,842 --> 02:06:03,382
Grow up.

953
02:06:04,899 --> 02:06:08,499
Kayı's enemies will grow up.

954
02:06:09,412 --> 02:06:11,832
We'll have so many enemies...

955
02:06:13,026 --> 02:06:16,066
like Nikola.

956
02:06:19,222 --> 02:06:24,722
The ruler in Constantinople
will come here.

957
02:06:29,777 --> 02:06:31,677
Father.

958
02:06:31,892 --> 02:06:34,312
We don't have time.

959
02:06:35,050 --> 02:06:37,820
We should set a new way.

960
02:06:38,214 --> 02:06:40,824
We should be organized again.

961
02:07:50,564 --> 02:07:52,614
Say what you'll say.

962
02:07:53,435 --> 02:07:56,835
Don't keep it inside you.

963
02:07:58,637 --> 02:07:59,897
I will say it.

964
02:08:00,795 --> 02:08:02,215
I will.

965
02:08:03,235 --> 02:08:05,795
However, I'm afraid of what I'll hear.

966
02:08:08,659 --> 02:08:10,409
Savcı Bey...

967
02:08:11,326 --> 02:08:13,406
did you choose Osman?

968
02:08:24,636 --> 02:08:27,206
My uncle deceived me, Lena.

969
02:08:28,179 --> 02:08:32,179
You warned me many times but I didn't
listen to you.

970
02:08:34,093 --> 02:08:37,043
He bought Beys for himself.

971
02:08:37,719 --> 02:08:40,399
Whether my Uncle was going to be Bey...

972
02:08:40,552 --> 02:08:42,262
or Osman.

973
02:08:45,696 --> 02:08:48,256
I preferred Osman.

974
02:08:53,626 --> 02:08:56,226
You preferred Osman.

975
02:08:58,676 --> 02:09:02,226
You preferred Bala to Hazal!

976
02:09:02,276 --> 02:09:06,276
- So, I have to obey Bala!
- Lena!

977
02:09:08,572 --> 02:09:11,282
Stop thinking about yourself.

978
02:09:11,338 --> 02:09:14,018
Our Beylic is under a threat.

979
02:09:14,242 --> 02:09:18,242
Osman's greed and desperateness will
endanger us!

980
02:09:21,994 --> 02:09:24,984
You should've thought that earlier.

981
02:09:25,055 --> 02:09:26,955
Can I come in?

982
02:09:38,771 --> 02:09:40,171
My Bayhoca.

983
02:09:43,366 --> 02:09:44,816
Mother.

984
02:09:45,293 --> 02:09:48,143
- Mother.
- Son!

985
02:09:48,320 --> 02:09:51,140
I came to you.

986
02:09:51,728 --> 02:09:53,858
Welcome, son.

987
02:09:53,940 --> 02:09:57,030
I wish I came earlier.

988
02:09:57,105 --> 02:10:00,305
Let me look at you.

989
02:10:00,649 --> 02:10:03,249
I missed you so much.

990
02:10:06,912 --> 02:10:08,822
Father.

991
02:10:09,917 --> 02:10:13,267
- Welcome, son. My son.
- Father.

992
02:10:15,237 --> 02:10:16,937
My brave son.

993
02:10:20,148 --> 02:10:24,148
Father, thank Allah that my uncle
Osman has become Bey.

994
02:10:25,445 --> 02:10:28,585
You've voted for him.

995
02:10:31,737 --> 02:10:33,857
That's nice.

996
02:10:34,171 --> 02:10:38,171
I'm so proud as your son.

997
02:10:42,251 --> 02:10:45,571
Of course my uncle Osman should be Bey.

998
02:10:45,713 --> 02:10:48,553
His brother Savcı Bey knows that, I said.

999
02:11:15,761 --> 02:11:17,141
From now on...

1000
02:11:18,170 --> 02:11:22,070
my brother Göktuğ is the Head of Alps.

1001
02:11:27,418 --> 02:11:29,568
Your command, my Bey.

1002
02:11:30,220 --> 02:11:33,500
Thank you.

1003
02:11:35,300 --> 02:11:37,120
My brother Boran...

1004
02:11:38,360 --> 02:11:40,870
will come with me.

1005
02:11:41,198 --> 02:11:45,518
He'll be with me wherever I go.

1006
02:11:47,445 --> 02:11:51,795
Only he'll know my secrets.

1007
02:11:53,461 --> 02:11:57,311
- Your command, my Bey.
- Thank you.

1008
02:12:00,499 --> 02:12:02,779
My uncle and my brother...

1009
02:12:02,918 --> 02:12:06,688
they didn't come to...

1010
02:12:07,128 --> 02:12:11,818
any of my ceremony.

1011
02:12:14,170 --> 02:12:15,290
Apparently...

1012
02:12:16,668 --> 02:12:19,128
they will stand up to my Beyhood.

1013
02:12:21,424 --> 02:12:23,634
Watch them.

1014
02:12:23,811 --> 02:12:25,711
Thank you, my Bey.

1015
02:12:26,344 --> 02:12:28,084
About Flatyos...

1016
02:12:28,819 --> 02:12:31,359
because of what he did to Beys of Kayı...

1017
02:12:31,619 --> 02:12:33,639
he'll be hanged tomorrow.

1018
02:12:35,906 --> 02:12:41,366
That Nikola dog will also
be hanged when I have him.

1019
02:13:20,385 --> 02:13:22,765
Eat all of them.

1020
02:13:24,943 --> 02:13:28,163
- You'll be hanged soon.
- You're right.

1021
02:13:28,315 --> 02:13:31,615
I shouldn't go to the other side hungry.
Is there wine?

1022
02:14:14,782 --> 02:14:17,832
Is it for that dog?

1023
02:14:19,224 --> 02:14:23,004
- Inshallah, it will be his last meal.
- Inshallah.

1024
02:14:52,738 --> 02:14:54,778
What's happening?

1025
02:14:56,858 --> 02:15:00,628
Are you okay?
Do you hear me?

1026
02:15:52,063 --> 02:15:56,063
Thank you, buddy, both for the
ayran (a Turkish drink) and...

1027
02:15:56,485 --> 02:16:00,485
your clothes.
Can you just...--

1028
02:16:04,594 --> 02:16:06,884
Go, now.

1029
02:16:07,252 --> 02:16:11,252
We'll talk to Bamsı Bey.

1030
02:16:20,500 --> 02:16:22,870
Sons.

1031
02:16:33,846 --> 02:16:35,456
Bamsı Bey...

1032
02:16:36,744 --> 02:16:38,654
Bamsı Bey...

1033
02:16:41,544 --> 02:16:43,794
Tell me now.

1034
02:16:44,112 --> 02:16:45,882
Where do we go first?

1035
02:16:46,653 --> 02:16:48,833
To who?

1036
02:16:49,520 --> 02:16:54,160
Do you know where to go, Osman Bey?

1037
02:16:56,269 --> 02:17:00,459
We'll go to your father, Ertuğrul Ghazi.

1038
02:17:26,653 --> 02:17:28,303
Osman.

1039
02:17:29,698 --> 02:17:33,468
He is the Bey of Kayı.

1040
02:17:36,627 --> 02:17:40,017
Osman wouldn't let
Savcı and Dündar to be Beys.

1041
02:17:41,181 --> 02:17:44,291
- Are you surprised?
- Petros.

1042
02:17:44,784 --> 02:17:47,184
Of course, no.

1043
02:17:47,468 --> 02:17:51,028
So, Dündar Bey betrayed Savcı.

1044
02:17:56,386 --> 02:17:59,416
And Savcı betrayed Dündar Bey.

1045
02:18:00,818 --> 02:18:04,198
And Osman became Bey.

1046
02:18:09,591 --> 02:18:12,641
What are you thinking, Petros?

1047
02:18:14,886 --> 02:18:18,886
To kill two birds with one stone.

1048
02:18:22,180 --> 02:18:23,560
Maybe three.

1049
02:18:23,876 --> 02:18:25,036
Maybe five.

1050
02:18:25,434 --> 02:18:31,194
We'll not only destroy Osman's reputation
with the stones we throw...

1051
02:18:31,490 --> 02:18:35,490
but also, we'll give
opportunity to Dündar...

1052
02:18:37,138 --> 02:18:39,188
who wants something else.

1053
02:18:39,352 --> 02:18:40,432
So?

1054
02:18:42,510 --> 02:18:45,330
We'll make Dündar collaborate with us.

1055
02:18:46,961 --> 02:18:48,511
How?

1056
02:18:53,192 --> 02:18:55,202
That's my job.

1057
02:18:58,764 --> 02:19:00,544
My brother.

1058
02:19:34,974 --> 02:19:38,544
Do you think they can finish Osman?

1059
02:19:40,184 --> 02:19:43,314
They'll try, Helen.

1060
02:19:43,666 --> 02:19:45,716
Let them try.

1061
02:19:45,905 --> 02:19:47,895
Okay, Vladius...

1062
02:19:49,472 --> 02:19:53,702
- Can they really do it?
- They'll try Helen!

1063
02:19:56,111 --> 02:19:59,931
I just thought that they may have a man
in Kayı tribe.

1064
02:19:59,987 --> 02:20:03,077
Of course, Helen.

1065
02:20:03,080 --> 02:20:08,540
Of course they may have.
I am sure they have a man here too.

1066
02:20:08,562 --> 02:20:12,852
The real issue is not that. What concerns
us is the question: What are they after?

1067
02:20:13,445 --> 02:20:17,475
This is the problem.
I want to figure this out.

1068
02:20:20,755 --> 02:20:26,185
Besides, it is really noteworthy that they
have come here in the time of election.

1069
02:20:30,860 --> 02:20:35,380
What happens when there is an election,
Helen?

1070
02:20:36,803 --> 02:20:40,503
- Someone take over the throne.
- Just that?

1071
02:20:41,675 --> 02:20:44,665
Some other things change as well.

1072
02:20:48,020 --> 02:20:54,340
So they have come here for
"some other things."

1073
02:20:55,958 --> 02:21:01,068
So Turks have secret plans too.

1074
02:21:02,770 --> 02:21:09,130
I'm not proud of it, but I also love
to have secret plans.

1075
02:21:20,390 --> 02:21:25,100
Osman Bey, I have a secret.

1076
02:21:25,794 --> 02:21:30,294
A secret that should be known only by you.

1077
02:21:31,426 --> 02:21:34,476
No one else is to known.

1078
02:21:35,424 --> 02:21:42,424
This is why I am explaining this to you.
This is Ertugrul Ghazi's heritage.

1079
02:21:42,617 --> 02:21:46,737
It's his relics.

1080
02:21:49,963 --> 02:21:53,383
Didn't we get all the relics today,
Bamsı Bey?

1081
02:21:55,355 --> 02:22:00,105
These are other relics, Osman Bey.

1082
02:22:00,152 --> 02:22:04,925
These are relics that have come down to
Kayı Beys from Turkish rulers.

1083
02:22:04,925 --> 02:22:09,955
These are almighty relics.

1084
02:22:13,047 --> 02:22:15,977
Why did I not know that before?

1085
02:22:19,866 --> 02:22:24,376
Osman Bey, if you hadn't been selected
as a Bey...

1086
02:22:24,421 --> 02:22:27,699
you wouldn't know it now.

1087
02:22:27,699 --> 02:22:32,809
Because these relics are handed
Beys to Beys.

1088
02:22:37,796 --> 02:22:40,136
When can I see?

1089
02:22:40,224 --> 02:22:44,674
Let's not waste time.
Let's depart.

1090
02:22:44,984 --> 02:22:55,224
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com